<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000-USDA. [CORRECTED 15:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000-USDA. [CORRECTED 15:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 100,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts Wednesday traded steady to firm compared with mid-session Tuesday. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
